    "created_at": "2021-09-21T16:29:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-21T16:29:45Z",
    "body": "Even though we recently implemented COOP/COEP in WebKit, I have no plan to add support for credentialless at the moment. It adds too much complexity and seems to have quite a few dependencies.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "reactions": {
