  {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/924157116",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6638#issuecomment-924157116",
    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/6638",
    "id": 924157116,
    "node_id": "IC_kwDOALaj4843FYS8",
    "user": {
      "login": "ArthurSonzogni",
      "id": 4759106,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTkxMDY=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4759106?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ArthurSonzogni/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "created_at": "2021-09-21T16:33:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-21T16:52:34Z",
    "body": "> This adds quite a bit of complexity.\r\n\r\n`COEP:credentialless` on its own is very lightweight. It can be implemented quickly in 3 steps:\r\n- Conditionally set to false `includeCredential` boolean in the fetch algorithm.\r\n- Add a case in the CORP check. Useful when moving a response in between two environment with different COEP policy.\r\n- In most places, replace  \"COEP == require-corp\" into \"COEP == (require-corp | credentialless)\".\r\n\r\nHowever, implementing the dependencies: Private Network Access and ORB is indeed not trivial.\r\n\r\nNote that it works independently from anonymous iframe, which doesn't really exist yet. I don't count this as a dependency. I added a [comment](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=230550) on the webkit bug I opened today.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/924157116/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
      "+1": 0,
      "-1": 0,
      "laugh": 0,
      "hooray": 0,
      "confused": 0,
      "heart": 0,
      "rocket": 0,
      "eyes": 0
    },
    "performed_via_github_app": null,
    "minimized": null
  },
  {
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/924180686",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6638#issuecomment-924180686",
    "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/6638",
    "id": 924180686,
    "node_id": "IC_kwDOALaj4843FeDO",
    "user": {
      "login": "arturjanc",
      "id": 665379,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTM3OQ==",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/665379?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/arturjanc",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/arturjanc/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "created_at": "2021-09-21T17:03:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-21T17:03:42Z",
    "body": "The argument about added complexity is reasonable, but I just wanted to note that there are substantial adoption benefits associated with `COEP:credentiallless`. Namely, while applications can in principle use COEP `require-corp` to enable cross-origin isolation, the requirement to ensure that every loaded resource explicitly opts in (via CORP or CORS) results in a large number of blocking issues that prevent developers from using COEP in most non-trivial applications.\r\n\r\nFor WebKit specifically, I wonder if the fact that it disables 3p cookies is an advantage in this context. As in, WebKit already sends cross-site requests as effectively credentialless, which aligns very well with the goal here -- this significantly reduces the risk associated with not implementing PNA/ORB. (Though note that same-site requests can still be a concern.)\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/924180686/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
      "+1": 0,
      "-1": 0,
      "laugh": 0,
      "hooray": 0,
      "confused": 0,
      "heart": 0,
      "rocket": 0,
      "eyes": 0
    },
    "performed_via_github_app": null,
    "minimized": null
